<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 384 0 R
/E (Welcome to the SMMUN, a space created for each and every one of you to find your voice, your purpose, and an experience that will truly transform you. Here, every single idea matters, every perspective has value, and every bit of participation will help shape what makes this edition so unique. Beyond the debates and resolutions, this model will be an opportunity to grow, to question ourselves, to learn, and to discover everything you are truly capable of.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
448 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 384 0 R
/E (As Secretary General, it is an absolute privilege to welcome you to an edition that we have prepared with so much hard work, hope, and love. I deeply believe that the most meaningful experiences happen when we step out of our comfort zones, when we dare to raise our placards even when our hands are shaking, and when we understand that listening to others is also a form of leadership. At SMMUN, we aren't looking for perfection; we want to build a space where all of you can feel safe to express yourselves, make mistakes, learn, and evolve both academically and personally.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
449 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 384 0 R
/E (Every single detail of this edition was thought out with the intention of making each delegation feel inspired, challenged, and valued. From the committee topics to the moments you will share outside of the sessions, our purpose has always been to create an experience that leaves a lasting impression on everyone involved. Because the SMMUN doesn't just exist because of the organization behind the project, but because of the energy, the ideas, and the essence that each of you brings to this model.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
