/E (We are truly honored to have you here and to begin this journey alongside you. Whether this is your very first Model United Nations or one of many, we want you to know that your presence in this committee is deeply valued. By choosing to be part of WWF, you are entering a space that seeks not only to encourage debate and academic growth, but also to foster collaboration and commitment toward some of the most urgent issues concerning wildlife, biodiversity, and the future of our natural world.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
512 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 388 0 R
/E (This committee seeks to be a space where ideas matter and every voice can contribute meaningfully. Through the topics we address, we hope you strengthen your skills in debate, research, and public speaking while developing a deeper understanding of our shared responsibility toward the environment.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
