/P 390 0 R
/E ( The World Wild Fund for Nature is a major international non-governmental organization \(NGO\) with over 100 offices around the world. Its structure is composed of WWF International \(located in Gland, Switzerland\) and is governed by a Director General and an International Board of Trustees. WWFs governing membership does not include states or rotating delegations, but includes national offices, experts, donors and partner institutions \(WWF, 2023a\). )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
