/E ( WWF expresses five areas of work as the pillars of their work: diversity conservation, sustainable resource opportunities, reducing the ecological footprint of humans, decision-making based on science, and collaboration with local communities and global actors. A principle is ensuring that conservation also respects human rights and indigenous peoples \(WWF, 2023b\).)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
