/E ( The World Wide Fund for Nature has been working for more than 60 years on nature conservation along with communities. recognizes that sustainable management of natural resources is possible through collaboration. It began in 1961 as a small group of nature enthusiasts and is now one of the largest and most respected independent conservation organizations in the world, active in more than 100 countries and with the support of around five million people. )
