/E (Statistical Data Supporting the Situation)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
729 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 405 0 R
/E ( Genetic variability the variability of genes within species is a basic component of biodiversity that can help populations successfully adapt to environmental changes, epidemiological emergencies, or extreme weather events. However, genetic diversity is declining across the globe, posing an urgent challenge to natural systems and human food security.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
